  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">African Investigative Journalism Grants Fund, FAIR</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">African Investigative Journalism Grants Fund, FAIR</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Att st&#xF6;tta journalister i Afrika finansiellt samt &#xF6;ka deras s&#xE4;kerhet, kompetens och oberoende. Genom att n&#xE5; ut med relevant, faktam&#xE4;ssigt   korrekt information om social or&#xE4;ttvisa och brott mot m&#xE4;nskliga       r&#xE4;ttigheter till allm&#xE4;nnheten &#xE4;r f&#xF6;rhoppningen att detta ska leda     till &#xF6;kade krav p&#xE5; tillg&#xE5;ng till information, deltagande och dialog   mellan makthavare och allm&#xE4;nnheten.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To support journalists in Africa financially as well as enhancing     their security, competence and independence. By media audiences being exposed to more relevant, fact-checked information regarding social   justice and human rights violations the  the demands for information, participation and dialogue between authorities and the public will    hopefully increase.</narrative>
  </description>
